{
  "title": "TB-3PO",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Two independent slots",
        "(A and B) run in",
        "parallel, each with",
        "its own pattern, MIDI",
        "channel, and banks.",
        "",
        "Load a resonant mono",
        "synth into a shadow",
        "slot (303, Bristol,",
        "OB-Xd, Moog, ...) and",
        "match its receive",
        "channel to the slot",
        "you want to drive."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pages",
      "lines": [
        "Each slot has its own",
        "ring of pages. Jog",
        "turns pages; Step",
        "buttons 1-6 jump",
        "straight to one.",
        "",
        "1 PERFORM  step lane +",
        "           knob row 0",
        "2 Pattern  8 knobs",
        "3 303      8 live CCs",
        "           (hidden with",
        "           no 303 loaded)",
        "4 Setup    Chan, Dir,",
        "           Transpose,",
        "           Bank",
        "5 Pads     pad map",
        "6 Keys     other",
        "           controls"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Slots (T1-T4)",
      "lines": [
        "T1  Slot A Pattern",
        "T2  Slot A 303",
        "T3  Slot B Pattern",
        "T4  Slot B 303",
        "",
        "Both slots sequence at",
        "all times. Track",
        "buttons switch which",
        "ring jog and the pads",
        "are editing, and jump",
        "straight to that page.",
        "",
        "The header always",
        "names the slot and",
        "page you are on."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Knobs - Pattern",
      "lines": [
        "Row 0 (knobs 1-4):",
        "1 Density  chance of a",
        "           note vs rest",
        "2 Accent   chance of a",
        "           loud note",
        "3 Slide    chance of a",
        "           slide into",
        "           the next note",
        "4 Gate     note length",
        "           (% of step)",
        "",
        "Row 1 (knobs 5-8):",
        "5 Root     key root",
        "6 Scale    Minor /",
        "           Phrygian /",
        "           HarmMinor /",
        "           MinPent /",
        "           Dorian /",
        "           Major",
        "7 Length   8/16/24/32",
        "           steps",
        "8 Octaves  octave range",
        "           (1-3)",
        "",
        "Knobs 1-4 also drive",
        "PERFORM's row 0, so",
        "the same knob means",
        "the same thing on both",
        "pages. Any of these",
        "marks the pattern",
        "stale -- press GEN",
        "(pad 1) to regenerate,",
        "or MUT (pad 2) to",
        "nudge ~25% of steps."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Knobs - 303",
      "lines": [
        "Live CC controller for",
        "a schwung-303 on the",
        "slot's MIDI channel.",
        "",
        "1  Cutoff    (CC 74)",
        "2  Resonance (CC 71)",
        "3  Decay     (CC 75)",
        "4  Env Mod   (CC 70)",
        "5  Accent    (CC 16)",
        "6  Volume    (CC 7)",
        "7  Drive     (CC 12)",
        "8  Drive Mix (CC 13)",
        "",
        "On page entry, knob",
        "values sync to the",
        "plugin's current",
        "params so the first",
        "turn doesn't jump."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Knobs - Setup",
      "lines": [
        "1  Chan       MIDI out",
        "              channel",
        "2  Dir        Fwd / Rev",
        "              / Ping /",
        "              Rnd",
        "3  Transpose  +/- 1",
        "              octave",
        "4  Bank       readout",
        "              only -- set",
        "              banks from",
        "              the pad row",
        "",
        "Row 1 (knobs 5-8) is",
        "empty on this page."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pads (4 rows, top = row 3)",
      "lines": [
        "Row 3 (top): steps 1-8",
        "             of the",
        "             current",
        "             step page.",
        "Row 2:       steps 9-16.",
        "             Tap cycles",
        "             rest > note",
        "             > accent >",
        "             slide.",
        "Row 1:       pattern",
        "             banks 1-8.",
        "             Tap = recall",
        "             (queued to",
        "             next bar if",
        "             playing).",
        "             Shift+tap =",
        "             save current",
        "             to bank.",
        "             Length is",
        "             saved with",
        "             the bank,",
        "             and comes",
        "             back too.",
        "Row 0:       1 GEN  new",
        "               pattern",
        "               from a",
        "               fresh seed",
        "             2 MUT  nudge",
        "               ~25% of",
        "               existing",
        "               steps",
        "             3 DIR  cycle",
        "               play",
        "               direction",
        "             4 Ch-  MIDI",
        "               channel",
        "               down",
        "             5 Ch+  MIDI",
        "               channel",
        "               up",
        "",
        "The on-screen Pads",
        "page shows this map",
        "live, and inverts the",
        "bank row while Shift",
        "is held."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Hardware buttons",
      "lines": [
        "+ / -   transpose +/-1",
        "        octave (clamped",
        "        +/-48 semitones)",
        "< / >   step page (for",
        "        24/32-step",
        "        patterns)",
        "X (Del) CLEAR -- gated,",
        "        requires",
        "        Shift+X",
        "Undo    revert last",
        "        GEN / MUTATE /",
        "        CLEAR",
        "Play    transport",
        "        (passthrough to",
        "        Move firmware)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "LED colors",
      "lines": [
        "Steps:  white=note,",
        "        red=accent,",
        "        blue=slide,",
        "        off=rest.",
        "Cursor: current step",
        "        blinks yellow.",
        "Banks:  purple=current,",
        "        teal=filled,",
        "        off=empty.",
        "        Yellow flash =",
        "        bank queued for",
        "        next-bar recall.",
        "        Shift held: row",
        "        pulses red/pink",
        "        (save targets).",
        "Actions: teal GEN,",
        "        indigo MUT,",
        "        orange DIR.",
        "Tracks: bright teal =",
        "        active Pattern",
        "        page, bright",
        "        orange = active",
        "        303 page."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Suspend & exit",
      "lines": [
        "Back            close",
        "an open option list",
        "first; otherwise hide",
        "TB-Steps and keep both",
        "slots sequencing in",
        "the background.",
        "",
        "Shift+Back      fully",
        "exit (release notes,",
        "unload).",
        "",
        "Shift+Vol+Back  also",
        "suspend (host-level",
        "escape).",
        "",
        "Shift+Vol+Jog   also",
        "full exit.",
        "",
        "Re-open from Tools ->",
        "resumes with patterns",
        "and page position",
        "intact for both slots."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sync",
      "lines": [
        "Tempo follows Move's",
        "project BPM by",
        "itself.",
        "",
        "TB-Steps follows Move's",
        "transport. Start",
        "rewinds both slots to",
        "step 1, Continue",
        "resumes in place, and",
        "Stop stops them and",
        "releases held notes.",
        "",
        "If a transport byte",
        "is missed, it",
        "re-syncs from the",
        "host after about",
        "200 ms."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Credits",
      "lines": [
        "Algorithm: djphazer /",
        "Hemisphere Suite",
        "(TB_Steps applet)",
        "",
        "Schwung port: Charles",
        "Vestal -- GPL-3.0"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
